From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 07:30:16 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 039/104] soc: samsung: exynos-chipid: add Exynos7570 SoC ID

The Exynos7570 reports product ID 0xE7570202 (product 0xE7570, revision
0x202), so the driver fails with 'Unknown SoC' on it. Add it to the list and
document the samsung,exynos7570-chipid compatible.

Signed-off-by: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit bffbcbfca82ac313cfbe5143805150c703d48994)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/hwinfo/samsung,exynos-chipid.yaml        | 1 +
 drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c                              | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwinfo/samsung,exynos-chipid.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwinfo/samsung,exynos-chipid.yaml
index 54699583f..7dba5d0bd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwinfo/samsung,exynos-chipid.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwinfo/samsung,exynos-chipid.yaml
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - samsung,exynos5433-chipid
               - samsung,exynos7-chipid
+              - samsung,exynos7570-chipid
               - samsung,exynos7870-chipid
           - const: samsung,exynos4210-chipid
       - items:
diff --git a/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c b/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c
index 5c21fc750..0f7ee422f 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ static const struct exynos_soc_id {
 	{ "EXYNOS5440", 0xE5440000 },
 	{ "EXYNOS5800", 0xE5422000 },
 	{ "EXYNOS7420", 0xE7420000 },
+	{ "EXYNOS7570", 0xE7570000 },
 	{ "EXYNOS7870", 0xE7870000 },
 	/* Compatible with: samsung,exynos850-chipid */
 	{ "EXYNOS7885", 0xE7885000 },
